{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Pawblem Careline</strong>, you\u2019ll become the exclusive customer service agent for cats, handling complaints and requests from various felines:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/fa4d8c69e8163fde62e69713859b25c8.webp?t=1766346047\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/5d5f1b3e8609e23b4c0bc9098d2aae3e.poster.avif?t=1766346047\" width=614 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/5d5f1b3e8609e23b4c0bc9098d2aae3e.webm?t=1766346047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/5d5f1b3e8609e23b4c0bc9098d2aae3e.mp4?t=1766346047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each choice you make will open a different badge from the customer service card pack. Every cat has its own unique badge for players to collect. Additionally, there are special calls and exclusive badges from mysterious characters every day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/3b470ec0e938985a8f21aabd94e117d9.webp?t=1766346047\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/4f850f86e11adbc885fcbf6bfe33d9d7.poster.avif?t=1766346047\" width=614 height=170 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/4f850f86e11adbc885fcbf6bfe33d9d7.webm?t=1766346047\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/4f850f86e11adbc885fcbf6bfe33d9d7.mp4?t=1766346047\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After each round of calls, players can sell their collected badges to anonymous sellers in the market, helping to save this hotline service company that\u2019s dedicated to cats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/8021537c6cbe933b724fcae7211a7ed6.webp?t=1766346047\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can choose to accumulate badges and unlock photos to decorate their collection board. Every time a photo is completed, it will reveal a part of the cat character\u2019s backstory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/extras/b9a4fba61d78c841b297d6fcfcd34905.webp?t=1766346047\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3483950?t=1766346047","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1766346047","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/36f98ee6fda548ba0ad940cc39f7f19e7c78f1ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766346047","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3483950/36f98ee6fda548ba0ad940cc39f7f19e7c78f1ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766346047","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Pawblem Careline</strong>, 